sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Main
    participant C as Controller
    participant W as Workers
    participant S as Screens
    participant SD as SD Card
    participant I2C as I2C Bus
    
    M->>C: Initialize Controller
    M->>W: Initialize Workers
    Note over W: Key Workers:<br/>- BatteryIndicator (AXP2101)<br/>- GpsConnector (UBLOX)<br/>- SoundManager<br/>- LogAggregator<br/>- LocalStorage<br/>- GeigerCounter
    
    M->>W: Start Default Workers
    loop Worker Initialization
        W->>BatteryIndicator: Initialize AXP2101
        W->>GpsConnector: Initialize GPS
        W->>SoundManager: Load sound state
        W->>LocalStorage: Load settings
    end
    
    M->>S: Show BootScreen
    Note over S: Displays:<br/>- Device name/version<br/>- User/Device ID<br/>- RTC time/date<br/>- Battery status
    
    loop Main Loop
        M->>W: Update Workers
        W->>BatteryIndicator: Read voltage/charge
        W->>GpsConnector: Process NMEA
        W->>SoundManager: Handle clicks
        W->>LogAggregator: Aggregate sensor data
        
        M->>S: Update Display
        alt Every 6s or User Input
            C->>SD: Check status
            alt SD Card OK
                C->>LocalStorage: Get device_id
                alt First Boot
                    C->>S: Show FirstTimeStartupScreen
                else Normal Boot
                    C->>S: Show DefaultEntryScreen
                end
            else SD Error
                C->>S: Show SdMessageScreen
            end
        end
    end